                    modern application development.
                </p>

                <ul>
                    <li>Developing web applications with ASP.NET Core.</li>
                    <li>Building desktop applications with .NET.</li>
                    <li>Working with PostgreSQL, MySQL, and SQL Server.</li>
                    <li>Learning modern software development practices.</li>
